-- %s #2: %s #2: the group searched, either "Party" or "Raid or Party", e.g. "Raid or Party"
-- %s #3: %s #3: " (including pets)" in parentheses when pets count, otherwise empty, e.g. " (including pets)"
-- %d #4: %d #4: the distance in yards, e.g. 40
